  "title": "Asake Talks ‘M$NEY,’ New Sounds, and His New Only-on-Spotify Concert Film",
  "summary": "When two-time Grammy nominee Asake partnered with Spotify for a special one-night-only concert at London’s Theatre Royal Drury Lane last month, the goal was simple: create an unforgettable night for the Nigerian artist’s top fans, friends, and family. Asake delivered just that, bringing his chart-topping album M$NEY to life live onstage for the first time. ...",
